sequenceDiagram
    participant Owner as Workspace Owner
    participant Browser
    participant GH as github.com
    participant Callback as /github/callback
    participant TokenSvc as GitHubTokenService
    participant DB as Postgres

    Owner->>Browser: click "Connect GitHub"
    Browser->>GH: redirect to https://github.com/apps/{slug}/installations/new?state={ws_slug}
    GH-->>Owner: install UI (select org/repos)
    Owner->>GH: confirm install
    GH-->>Browser: redirect to /github/callback?installation_id=...&setup_action=install&state={ws_slug}
    Browser->>Callback: GET /github/callback
    Callback->>TokenSvc: generateAppJwt() — RS256, 10-min lifetime
    TokenSvc->>GH: GET https://api.github.com/app/installations/{id} (Bearer JWT)
    GH-->>TokenSvc: installation metadata (id, account, avatar)
    Callback->>DB: GitHubInstallation::create([workspace_id, github_installation_id, account_login, account_type, avatar_url])
    Callback-->>Browser: redirect /workspaces/{ws}?tab=integrations
